   "evidence": "`isAddFG_posRootCone` is declared only in the `CharZero` section for `R.posRootCone`. The `CoweightLattice` namespace declares `posRootCone`, `isPointed_posRootCone` and `coe_mem_posRootCone_iff` but no `IsAddFG` instance. `ofConeBounded` requires `[IsAddFG C]`. README \u00a74.2: 'For `M` with weights in `j_k(P)` the `P`-indexed character extends by zero to the ambient one.'",
   "file": "TauCeti/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Cartan/Realization/CharacterRing.lean",
   "fix": "Add `instance [Finite I] : IsAddFG L.posRootCone.toAddSubmonoid`, proved like the ambient instance from `Set.range L.root` and `Submodule.span_nat_eq_addSubmonoidClosure`.",
   "issue": "The ambient cone gets an `IsAddFG` instance (`isAddFG_posRootCone`), but `CoweightLattice.posRootCone` does not. So `HahnSeries.ofConeBounded` and `ConeExponent.isPWO_Ici` cannot be used on `CoweightLattice.CharacterRing`. Roadmap \u00a74.2 needs P-indexed characters built from weight multiplicities and extended by zero.",
