   "fix": "Add `@[simp]` lemmas `ofConeExponent_nsmul`, `ofConeExponent_zsmul` and `toConeExponent_zsmul`, each `:= (rfl)`.",
   "issue": "`ConeExponent` has `SMul \u2115` and `SMul \u2124` instances. Zero, add, neg and sub each get `@[simp]` coercion lemmas in both directions, but scalar multiplication only has `toConeExponent_nsmul`, so `simp` cannot push `n \u2022 x` or `z \u2022 x` through `ofConeExponent`.",
